# B2-002: one-off developer/debug scripts (e.g. a scratch script that seeds a platform
# account with a hardcoded password, or pokes a DB field for local testing) must never be
# committed — this pattern is how _tmp_user.ts/_tmp_rel.ts ended up in history with a real
# credential in them. Name any throwaway script this way; it will never be picked up by git.
**/_tmp_*.ts
**/_tmp_*.mjs
**/_tmp_*.cjs
**/_tmp_*.js
**/*.scratch.*
# Rebuilt from the versioned central library before each frontend build.
**/public/assets/menu/description-matched-v1/
**/public/assets/menu/template-photos-v1/
**/public/assets/branding/kiosk-welcome-v1/
